SUMMARY:Winyah
LOCATION:Royale\, 279 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116
DESCRIPTION:with Foxtide\nIt’s in the crackle of their guitars\, the grow
 l of Thomas Rowland’s voice\, and the way their songs always feel like t
 hey’re chasing something – a feeling\, a high\, a truth you can’t qu
 ite name. With southern swagger\, indie rock bite\, and a live show that h
 its\, the South Carolina five-piece have quickly emerged as one of the mos
 t exciting new bands in the country. Their songs are gritty and real – f
 ull of friction\, soul\, and defiance – and their high-energy live shows
  are like a shot of adrenaline.\nhttps://www.axs.com/events/1448391/winyah
 -tickets\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
